ReSaver++ is a C++ port of ReSaver (FallrimTools) by Mark Fairchild,
distributed under Apache License 2.0. Starfield format research and
implementation: Tonycubed2/ResaverPP contributors.

Relevant upstream sources: src/core/SaveSF.cpp, SaveSFRefr.cpp, Save.cpp,
and Papyrus.h. These informed BCPS framing, plugin metadata, packed
references, change-form framing/type runs, and initial position layout.
This project implements a limited Python reader and same-length position
patcher. It does not include the upstream GUI, full decoder, or dependencies.
The original algorithms have been adapted and modified for this purpose.

Additional public format documentation consulted:
Nexus-Mods/StarfieldSaveTool, by Simon Davies (insomnious) and Nexus Mods.
https://github.com/Nexus-Mods/StarfieldSaveTool
